    "Name": "Celerity",
    "Details": "This Celerity model uses a smaller engine, limiting it to a top speed of approximately 230 km/h. It also removes the MASC system and some armor to make room for a TSEMP One-Shot.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Quad Mech (Squad)</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.94</color></b>",
